@title Machine options: a routed wire of a left-out page is veiled along its strokes
@area Options
# The Cooling fan page (page 3) of this fixture has two routed wires (wires 20 and 22 bend out to the sides of wire 21). With the fan off the veil
# follows each wire's own strokes instead of a box, and the hover says why. With the fan on the page is normal.
open qa/fixtures/machine-options-routed.novo
wait 20
expect "Options: no Cooling fan, Supply 400V"
key PageDown
wait 4
key PageDown
wait 6
shot fan-off-routed-wires-veiled
check_layout
move 313 330
wait 4
shot fan-off-routed-wire-hover
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan on
wait 4
key Enter
wait 8
shot fan-on-routed-wires-normal
check_layout
